<p><span id="u-credit-00314" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00314" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00314-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/songxueyao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5669943); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5669943&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608882148" alt="songxueyao" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5669943)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/songxueyao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5669943); return false;">songxueyao</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1594710834 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">14 Jul 2020 07:13</span></p>
